  "title": "Futu Repurchased Approximately US$160 Million ADSs in Share Repurchase",
  "summary": "HONG KONG, May 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Futu Holdings Limited (\"Futu\" or the \"Company\") (Nasdaq: Futu), today announced that as of May 23, 2026, the Company has repurchased approximately US$160 million worth of its American depositary shares (\"ADSs\"), representing its Class A ordinary shares.",
